      "vectors[].expected.counter": "Decimal integer (as a string for >2^53 safety) — the smallest non-negative counter producing a valid hash.",
      "vectors[].expected.tokenHashHex": "lowercase hex of SHA-256(token) — convenient for debugging leading-zero-bit checks.",
      "vectors[].expected.token": "The full token string `attn-pow:v2:...:<counter>` that meets the difficulty."
    },
    "filledBy": "attn-nnj.1.7 (Hashcash PoW mint + verify)",
